<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Adobe - 標籤 | 奇風歲月</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/adobe/</link><description>独立开发者 Travis Bikkle 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.139.3 &amp; FixIt v0.3.15-fd15415b</generator><language>zh-hant</language><managingEditor>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</managingEditor><webMaster>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Dec 2024 12:50:59 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/adobe/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>使用 Adobe Premiere 製作 GIF 文件</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/05/adobe-premiere-gif/</link><pubDate>Wed, 31 May 2023 11:24:28 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/2023/05/adobe-premiere-gif/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/zh-hant/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>雙擊左下角媒體瀏覽器，將視頻素材導入
&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_1.png" alt="/images/other/20230531_premiere_1.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_1.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_1.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_1.png?size=large 2x" data-title="/images/other/20230531_premiere_1.png" style="--width: 1920px;--aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1031;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>在左上角編輯窗口，點擊如圖所示按鈕，標記入點與出點（開始與結束）
&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_start_end.png" alt="/images/other/20230531_premiere_start_end.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_start_end.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_start_end.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_start_end.png?size=large 2x" data-title="/images/other/20230531_premiere_start_end.png" style="--width: 962px;--aspect-ratio: 962 / 540;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>將左上角的內容拖動到右下角時間軸內
&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_drap_and_drop.gif" alt="/images/other/20230531_premiere_drap_and_drop.gif" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_drap_and_drop.gif?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_drap_and_drop.gif?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230531_premiere_drap_and_drop.gif?size=large 2x" data-title="/images/other/20230531_premiere_drap_and_drop.gif" style="--width: 512px;--aspect-ratio: 512 / 319;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>右鍵點擊時間軸內的波段，點擊取消鏈接，再次右鍵，選擇清除聲音軌道的波紋，以刪除聲音
&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_delete_voice.png" alt="/images/other/20230523_premiere_delete_voice.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_delete_voice.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_delete_voice.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_delete_voice.png?size=large 2x" data-title="/images/other/20230523_premiere_delete_voice.png" style="--width: 628px;--aspect-ratio: 628 / 740;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>選擇 文件-&amp;gt;導出-&amp;gt;媒體，選擇 &lt;strong>動畫GIF&lt;/strong> 格式，調整大小後導出
&lt;img loading="lazy" src="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_export_gif.png" alt="/images/other/20230523_premiere_export_gif.png" srcset="https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_export_gif.png?size=small, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_export_gif.png?size=medium 1.5x, https://travisbikkle.github.io/images/other/20230523_premiere_export_gif.png?size=large 2x" data-title="/images/other/20230523_premiere_export_gif.png" style="--width: 1914px;--aspect-ratio: 1914 / 965;background: url(/images/loading.min.svg) no-repeat center;" onload="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}this.dataset.lazyloaded='';" onerror="this.title=this.dataset.title;for(const i of ['style', 'data-title','onerror','onload']){this.removeAttribute(i);}"/>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol></description></item></channel></rss>